==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*peittädäk}}, possibly derived from a borrowing of {{der|fi|gem-pro|*bēaną|*bē(j)aną}}. Related to {{cog|et|peitma}}, {{cog|izh|peittää}}, {{cog|lud|peitada}}, {{cog|vep|peittädä}} and {{cog|vot|peittää}} {{q|Kattila}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-p|*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}} {{tlb|fi|transitive}}

# to [[cover]]
#: {{ux|fi|Ei saa '''peittää'''|Do not '''cover''' [warning label on things like radiators]|lit=Not allowed '''to cover'''}}
# {{lb|fi|audio}} to [[mask]], [[cover]] with [[noise]]
#: {{syn|fi|maskata}}

